{
  "Strings": {
    "String": [
      {
        "refId": "1ed6e30e-6c7f-4970-79b7-802f0fae7408",
        "string": "<span style=\"line-height: 1.42857;\"><font size=\"3\">春意盎然的一天，Max（麦克斯）和Mia（米娅）正在近距离观察公园里那些争奇斗艳的花朵和忙碌的小蜜蜂。&#160;</font></span><div><span style=\"line-height: 1.42857;\"><font size=\"3\"><br></font></span></div><div><span style=\"line-height: 1.42857;\"><font size=\"3\">他们想进步了解花与它周围小动物之间的关系。&#160;</font></span></div>"
      },
      {
        "refId": "e1f3b987-e02b-4478-1064-76a51d683354",
        "string": "<div><font size=\"4\">Max（麦克斯）和Mia（米娅）在探究中的疑问：</font></div><div><span style=\"line-height: 1.42857143;\"><font size=\"3\"><br></font></span></div><div><span style=\"line-height: 1.42857143;\"><font size=\"3\">1. 一朵花是由哪几部分构成的？&#160;</font></span></div><div><span style=\"line-height: 1.42857143;\"><font size=\"3\">2. 生物（动物和昆虫）是如何帮助植物繁衍的？&#160;</font></span></div><div><span style=\"line-height: 1.42857143;\"><font size=\"3\">3.传粉的媒介有哪些？&#160;</font></span></div><div><font size=\"3\"><span style=\"line-height: 1.42857143;\">4.花粉传递过程叫什么？&#160;</span><br></font></div><div><span style=\"line-height: 1.42857143;\"><font size=\"3\"><br></font></span></div><div><font size=\"3\" color=\"#ffffff\">用乐高文档来分享你的想法。</font><span style=\"line-height: 1.42857143;\"><br></span></div>"
      },
      {
        "refId": "90b1b939-544c-4339-32a7-7bf54f35a8e0",
        "string": "<div><span style=\"line-height: 1.42857;\"><font size=\"3\">用乐高积木搭建一只小蜜蜂绕着一朵鲜花飞舞。</font></span><br></div>"
      },
      {
        "refId": "248a9f42-8469-4c6e-b2b1-64c82f192e78",
        "string": "<div><font size=\"3\">给蜜蜂编写程序，使其可以在花朵上停留，并且可以顺利传播花粉。<br></font></div>"
      },
      {
        "refId": "0c165a49-c4b1-402e-cc15-6fd169f3172d",
        "string": "<div><font size=\"3\">打开智能集线器，并连接上电脑。可以通过观看相应的影音视频来获得帮助。&#160;</font></div><font size=\"3\"><br></font><div><font size=\"3\">如需更多详细指导，请看帮助。&#160;</font><br></div>"
      },
      {
        "refId": "bd9689bb-8482-4a1c-24f4-c558e5fa63b6",
        "string": "<div><font size=\"3\"><span style=\"line-height: 1.42857;\">根据之前的学习经验，搭建其他种类的花朵和传粉者，并使其可以顺利地传播花粉。</span><br></font></div><font size=\"3\"><br></font><div><font size=\"3\">思考下面的任意两个问题：</font></div><div><font size=\"3\">1. 小鸟们最适合帮助管状花朵传播花粉。&nbsp;</font></div><div><font size=\"3\">2. 蝴蝶非常喜欢特殊颜色的花朵。&nbsp;</font></div><div><font size=\"3\">3. 花粉传播可以在两种不同的花之间进行（异花传粉）。&nbsp;</font></div><font size=\"3\"><br></font><div><font size=\"3\" color=\"#ffffff\">记录下如何正确搭配花朵和传粉者。</font><br></div>"
      },
      {
        "refId": "f2efc131-abe3-422b-36ea-9e1746fdda34",
        "string": "<div><font size=\"4\">完成你的乐高文档：</font></div><div><span style=\"line-height: 1.42857143;\"><font size=\"3\"><br></font></span></div><div><span style=\"line-height: 1.42857143;\"><font size=\"3\">1.解释在搭建模型的过程中所受到的局限。&#160;</font></span></div><div><span style=\"line-height: 1.42857143;\"><font size=\"3\">2. 请将重要的照片、截屏、录像或文字插入到乐高文档中。&#160;</font></span></div><div><span style=\"line-height: 1.42857143;\"><font size=\"3\">3.整理实验总结，向同学们解释单性花和双性花，并描述生物是如何帮助植物传种的。 &#160;</font></span></div>"
      },
      {
        "refId": "22896aef-5632-4d2e-e0f8-b49593eabc3a",
        "string": "<div><font size=\"4\">分享你的发现：</font></div><font size=\"3\"><br></font><div><font size=\"3\">根据你的探究结果，解释传粉者为植物传种所做出的贡献，请用非常鲜明的例子和乐高模型做示范。</font></div><div><font size=\"3\">&#160; </font></div><div><font size=\"3\" color=\"#ffffff\">＊注意语言的组织与专有名词的运用。</font><br></div><div><font size=\"3\"><br></font></div>"
      },
      {
        "refId": "e8080f5f-d4a8-4546-7c0d-f2cf11128489",
        "string": "<font size=\"4\">与Max（麦克斯）和Mia（米娅）深层探究。</font><br>"
      },
      {
        "refId": "6d909856-1718-4a63-08d8-0a8b8c297284",
        "string": "<font size=\"4\">分享你的乐高成果。</font><br>"
      },
      {
        "refId": "73471203-af01-47d6-dc41-8c6c1b00c0a2",
        "string": "<font size=\"3\">How do some organisms contribute to the life cycle of plants?</font><br><div><font size=\"3\"><br></font></div><br><div><font size=\"3\">In this project, you will:</font></div><br><div><font size=\"3\"><br></font></div><br><div><font size=\"3\">Explore how different organisms take an active role in plant reproduction.</font></div><br><div><font size=\"3\">Create and program a model of a bee and flower to mimic the relationship between the pollinator and the plant.</font></div><br><div><font size=\"3\">Present and document the different models you have created of plants and their pollinators.</font></div>"
      },
      {
        "refId": "bed7f84f-8072-4a14-39fe-8b841aaca44a",
        "string": "<div><font size=\"5\">How do some organisms contribute to the life cycle of plants?<br></font><div><span style=\"color: inherit; font-size: 12px; line-height: 1.42857143;\">In this project, you will:</span><br></div><div><span style=\"color: inherit; font-size: 12px; line-height: 1.42857143;\"><br></span></div><div><span style=\"color: inherit; font-size: 12px; line-height: 1.42857143;\">Explore how different organisms take an active role in plant reproduction.</span><br></div><div><font size=\"3\">Create and program a model of a bee and flower to mimic the relationship between the pollinator and the plant.</font></div><div><font size=\"3\">Present and document the different models you have created of plants and their pollinators.</font></div></div><div><font size=\"3\"><br></font></div><div>一些生物是如何为植物生命周期做出贡献的？&#160;\n</div><br><div>通过这个实验，你会：探究不同的生物是如何在植物繁殖中起到积极作用的。&#160;</div><div>创造一套仿真模型，并展示传粉者与植物之间的关系。</div><div>记录下你所创造的不同植物和传粉者，并做展示。&#160;<font size=\"3\"><br></font></div>"
      },
      {
        "refId": "db22a1ce-16cd-4069-f872-eecca801b820",
        "string": "<div><div><font size=\"5\">How do some organisms contribute to the life cycle of plants?<br></font><div><span style=\"color: inherit; font-size: 12px; line-height: 1.42857143;\">In this project, you will:</span><br></div><div><span style=\"color: inherit; font-size: 12px; line-height: 1.42857143;\"><br></span></div><div><span style=\"color: inherit; font-size: 12px; line-height: 1.42857143;\">Explore how different organisms take an active role in plant reproduction.</span><br></div><div><font size=\"3\">Create and program a model of a bee and flower to mimic the relationship between the pollinator and the plant.</font></div><div><font size=\"3\">Present and document the different models you have created of plants and their pollinators.</font></div></div><div><font size=\"3\"><br></font></div><div>一些生物是如何为植物生命周期做出贡献的？&#160;\n</div><br><div>通过这个实验，你会：探究不同的生物是如何在植物繁殖中起到积极作用的。&#160;</div><div>创造一套仿真模型，并展示传粉者与植物之间的关系。</div><div>记录下你所创造的不同植物和传粉者，并做展示。&#160;<font size=\"3\"><br></font></div></div>"
      },
      {
        "refId": "d32a68f1-37a6-46a3-a339-d5b57eadf721",
        "string": "<div><font size=\"5\">How do some organisms contribute to the life cycle of plants?<br></font><div><span style=\"color: inherit; font-size: 12px; line-height: 1.42857143;\">In this project, you will:</span><br></div><div><span style=\"color: inherit; font-size: 12px; line-height: 1.42857143;\"><br></span></div><div><span style=\"color: inherit; font-size: 12px; line-height: 1.42857143;\">Explore how different organisms take an active role in plant reproduction.</span><br></div><div><font size=\"3\">Create and program a model of a bee and flower to mimic the relationship between the pollinator and the plant.</font></div><div><font size=\"3\">Present and document the different models you have created of plants and their pollinators.</font></div></div><div><font size=\"3\"><br></font></div><div>一些生物是如何为植物生命周期做出贡献的？</div><div>通过这个实验，你会：&#160;\n</div><br><div>探究不同的生物是如何积极地帮助植物繁殖的。&#160;</div><div>创造一个蜜蜂和花的模型，使其模仿传粉者与植物之间的关系。&#160;</div><div>展示你所创造的不同植物和传粉者，并做记录。&#160;<font size=\"3\"><br></font></div>"
      },
      {
        "refId": "59076eff-8410-43d6-3d73-ea4f58d9c3b4",
        "string": "<div><div><span style=\"line-height: 1.42857;\"><font size=\"4\">一些生物是如何为植物生命周期做出贡献的？</font></span><br></div><div><font size=\"3\"><br></font></div><div><font size=\"3\">通过这个实验，你会：&#160; </font></div><div><font size=\"3\"><span style=\"line-height: 1.42857;\">•&#160;</span>探究不同的生物是如何积极地帮助植物繁殖。&#160;</font></div><div><font size=\"3\"><span style=\"line-height: 1.42857;\">•&#160;</span>创造一个蜜蜂和花的模型，使其模仿传粉者与植物之间的关系。&#160;</font></div><div><span style=\"line-height: 1.42857;\"><font size=\"3\">•&#160;</font></span><font size=\"3\"><font size=\"3\">展示你所创造的不同植物与传粉者，并做记录。&#160;</font><br></font></div></div>"
      },
      {
        "refId": "7f9c9614-0d01-4cd5-b7fa-504fc1294a98",
        "string": "5. 植物与授粉"
      },
      {
        "refId": "322b8ea4-3045-4c2e-233f-94b00d524e24",
        "string": "<div><font size=\"4\">运用模型,做深层探究:</font></div><font size=\"3\"><br></font><div><font size=\"3\">搭建一个已经授粉的花朵，并展示种子是如何传播的。&#160; </font></div><div><font size=\"3\"><br></font></div><div><font size=\"3\">思考以下的任意三种情况：</font></div><div><font size=\"3\">1. 胚珠形成后，果实和种子开始成长，花朵会凋谢。</font></div><div><font size=\"3\">2. 种子的传播来自有花的植物还是无花的植物？&#160;</font></div><div><font size=\"3\">3. 种子的传播需要通过生物。</font></div><div><font size=\"3\">4. 种子的传播可以通过其他途径吗？</font></div><div><font size=\"3\">5. 植物的繁衍必须通过种子的传播吗？&#160;</font></div><div><font size=\"3\"><br></font></div><div><font size=\"3\" color=\"#ffffff\">记录下种子传播的过程，稍后请做展示。&#160;</font><br></div>"
      }
    ]
  }
}